# Benchmark run output (stage 2-3).
#
# A run's raw result is regenerable and depends on whoever paid for it (key, model,
# network, day). Committing them makes the repository a place where only the good runs
# ever land — the exact self-deception `task/stage-2-4.md` forbids. The durable artefact
# is `labels.json` (a person's judgement, run-independent) plus the numbers written into
# `docs/benchmark/README.md`. Same for the generated per-run report; the template stays.
tests/benchmark/results/*
!tests/benchmark/results/.gitkeep
!tests/benchmark/results/labels.json
tests/benchmark/reports/*
!tests/benchmark/reports/.gitkeep
!tests/benchmark/reports/judgement-template.md

# Agent working notes (internal; never part of the public tree)
.workbuddy/
